            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>1.1.10 — Ask, Reader, Capture, and more</h3>
<ul>
<li><b>Ask this page</b> (⌘J): summarize a page or ask about it in a panel beside it. Runs on Apple's on-device model — free, and nothing leaves your Mac.</li>
<li><b>Reader view</b> (⇧⌘R): just the article, cleanly set, without the clutter.</li>
<li><b>Capture</b> (⇧⌘1): drag a box over any page to copy that part as an image.</li>
<li><b>Link preview</b>: ⇧-click a link to peek at it over the page, then close it or keep it as a tab.</li>
<li><b>Recent tabs</b> (⌃Tab): hold Control and tap Tab to flip between your most recent tabs, with previews. Next and previous tab are now ⇧⌘] and ⇧⌘[.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
